        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ice Prince, Wale, Rick Ross, Sunny Neji, M.I, Chip, Ruby Gyang, Wizkid, French Montana, Jesse Jagz, Olamide, Sound Sultan, Burna Boy, Yung L, Jeremiah Gyang, Shaydee, Morell\n- Projects: Fire of Zamani, I Swear, Self Made Vol.\n- Organizations: Maybach Music Group\n\nFacts:\n- In early 2011, Wale signed with Rick Ross' Maybach Music Group.\n- Fire of Zamani features guest appearances from Sunny Neji, Wale, M.I, Chip, Ruby Gyang, Wizkid, French Montana, Jesse Jagz, Olamide, Sound Sultan, Burna Boy, Yung L, Jeremiah Gyang, Shaydee, and Morell.\n- \"I Swear\" is a song by Nigerian hip hop artist Ice Prince that was released on September 9, 2013.\n- \"I Swear\" serves as the fourth single from Ice Prince's second studio album Fire of Zamani.",
